---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const seo = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy | KM Wellness Center | El Paso, TX',
  description:
    'KM Wellness Center privacy policy: how we collect, use, and protect your personal and protected health information.',
};
---
<BaseLayout {...seo}>
  <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' }]} />
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>
    See also our downloadable documents:
    <a href="/documents/Privacy-Policies-KMC.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy (PDF)</a>
    and
    <a href="/documents/Informed-Consent-KMC.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Informed Consent (PDF)</a>.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>Our website address is: https://kmwellnesscenter.com</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What Personal Data We Collect and Why</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Contact and Lead Forms.</strong> We collect information entered in our contact and lead
      forms for customer service purposes, which may include your name, email address, phone number,
      and any other details you provide.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Job Applications.</strong> When you apply through our careers page, we collect the contact
      information, resume, and optional message you submit. We use this information to review your
      qualifications and communicate with you about current or potential employment opportunities.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Email Marketing and SMS.</strong> When you separately sign up to receive marketing
      communications, you consent to receive email and/or SMS messages. You can opt out at any time.
      Submitting a job application does not enroll you in marketing communications.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Analytics.</strong> Our website uses Google Analytics 4 to collect information about the
      use of our site to help us improve it. Google Analytics collects the IP address assigned to you
      on the date you visit, not your name or other identifying information.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Advertising.</strong> We use the Meta Pixel and Google Ads remarketing to measure and
      serve advertising. You can opt out via Google Ads Settings and the Network Advertising Initiative
      opt-out page.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Security and Fraud Prevention.</strong> Our forms use Cloudflare Turnstile to verify you're
      not a bot, which may process your IP address and device/browser signals per Cloudflare's privacy
      policy. We also temporarily store the IP address of form submissions to detect and block abusive
      or automated activity.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who We Share Your Data With</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Resend.</strong> When you submit a contact form, lead form, or job application, the
      information and files you provide are processed by Resend, our email delivery service, solely
      to deliver your submission to our team.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Aziel Technologies.</strong> Our website is built and technically operated by
      <a href="https://www.aziel-technologies.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Aziel Technologies</a>,
      who has access to site infrastructure and submitted data in that capacity.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How We Protect Your Data</h2>
    <p>
      We implement security measures including secure servers, encrypted network communications,
      regular software updates, and malware protection. Staff are trained in data protection best
      practices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Your Rights &amp; Contact</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access the personal data we hold about you and request corrections or
      erasure (subject to data we must keep for legal, administrative, or security purposes).
    </p>
    <p>
      For privacy questions or data requests, contact: info@kmwellnesscenter.com ·
      (915) 444-5110 · 8623 N Loop Dr., Ste B, El Paso, Texas, 79907 (Mon–Fri 8AM–5PM).
    </p>
    <p>
      <em>This page summarizes the web privacy policy. The full HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices
      (protected health information uses, disclosures, and patient rights) is available in the
      <a href="/documents/Privacy-Policies-KMC.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">downloadable PDF above</a>.</em>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
